  "description": "The Belami 10 Wave pairs its slim, contemporary design with an easy-access low step-through frame, making it ideal for relaxed commuting and quick errands around town. The Bosch rear hub drive and compact 360Wh battery keep the bike responsive and give it a lightweight riding feel, while the 75mm SR Suntour suspension fork smooths out uneven streets and bumps along the way.\n\nA Shimano Cues 9-speed drivetrain ensures reliable shifting on changing gradients, and hydraulic disc brakes provide controlled braking in all conditions. Full Metasol fenders, a Racktime carrier, an Ursus kickstand and integrated lighting add daily convenience and visibility. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires provide reliable puncture protection and confident grip, ensuring a secure, low-stress ride through urban environments.",
